Z||000009||Steve Normington||08-03-2001||12:55 AM||||It's a Pegasus from the top. The head is at the top of the image, the two hind legs are at the bottom, and the tail is trailing between them. This image from Paul McKibben is a little easier to see.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/FPegLogo.jpg">  <p>[This message has been edited by Steve Normington (edited 08-03-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000010||AusFiero||08-03-2001||12:57 AM||||Hmmmmm First time I looked at it I seen a horse with wings, didn't know it was a pegasus at the time. But then again first time I looked at it was playing with it on the computer before I had a Fiero. Kinda looks obvious in that format. See below.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/pegasus.gif"> <P>Now that I look at the badge on my car it could get kinda confusing without any prior knowledge.<BR><P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero/ausfiero1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero" TARGET=_blank>My Fiero</A> | <A HREF="http://www.auto-alley.com" TARGET=_blank>Fiero Accessories</A>||202.139.20.3||reg||1
Z||000011||frontal lobe||08-03-2001||01:13 AM||||If you were good at those rorschach ink blot pictures, you could figure out the Fiero logo.  Being right brain dominant, I struggled for months figuring out what-was-what in that image, too.<P>Steve, I always thought it was a view from below as if it was flying above us, so now I'm confused AGAIN.  I'm NEVER going to get that thing figured out!||||reg||1
Z||000012||FieroHeather||08-03-2001||01:15 AM||||Im glad that I am/was not the only one who was confused with the image<P>Aus, your image looks like there is two horses, not one.  The pegasus of course, but then there is the looking like hooves in the center of the photo.||||reg||1
Z||000013||Steve Normington||08-03-2001||01:19 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by frontal lobe:<BR><B>Steve, I always thought it was a view from below as if it was flying above us, so now I'm confused AGAIN.  I'm NEVER going to get that thing figured out!</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P> <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by FieroHeather:<BR><B>Aus, your image looks like there is two horses, not one.  The pegasus of course, but then there is the looking like hooves in the center of the photo.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Lobee had it right. The view is from below the horse. I always thought the two front legs were stylized sides of the mane. Although, who shows a picture of a horse from the underside?!?! And, is it a gelding or a mare?||||reg||1
