Z||000015||DRH||08-03-2001||02:13 AM||||In the one AusFiero posted it looks like it's rearing up on it's hind legs. I never noticed the front legs before now. <P>The first time I saw it I thought it looked like a Phoenix. I guess that would be a different Pontiac though. Come to think of it... wasn't the Phoenix emblem similar???<BR>||||reg||1
