Z||000018||AusFiero||08-03-2001||04:03 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by DRH:<BR><B>In the one AusFiero posted it looks like it's rearing up on it's hind legs. I never noticed the front legs before now. <P>The first time I saw it I thought it looked like a Phoenix. I guess that would be a different Pontiac though. Come to think of it... wasn't the Phoenix emblem similar???</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Yep it is a front on view of it rearig up. They did the front legs and part of the head etc in a different colour to give it dimension.<P><P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero/ausfiero1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero" TARGET=_blank>My Fiero</A> | <A HREF="http://www.auto-alley.com" TARGET=_blank>Fiero Accessories</A>||202.139.20.3||reg||14
