Z||000024||Pontiaddict||08-03-2001||04:49 PM||||The part that throws people is the inverted colors for the front legs. If you don't know to look for them, it just looks like a bunch of squiggley lines. You're looking at the pegasus from straight ahead but it's flying almost straight up into the air I'm guessing it might be trying to land or do a vertical takeoff. ||||reg||1
